    1.00 nF  staggered        35.9   0.50    1.41          35.9          0.000166    7.7e-07    3.2e-26
    2.00 nF  simultaneous    108.4   0.10    1.00          54.2              5.52       1.88   0.000251
    2.00 nF  simultaneous    108.4   0.25    1.00          54.2              0.13    0.00884    1.8e-12
    2.00 nF  simultaneous    108.4   0.50    1.00          54.2          0.000251   1.16e-06   4.84e-26
    2.00 nF  staggered        35.9   0.10    1.00          18.0              1.83      0.625   8.31e-05
